    "seoTitle": "Restaurant Covers Needed to Break Even Per Night",
    "description": "Learn how to calculate restaurant covers needed to break even per night, then test seats, turns, margins, staffing, seasonality, and delivery capacity.",
    "metaDescription": "Learn how to calculate restaurant covers needed to break even per night, then test seats, turns, margins, staffing, seasonality, and delivery capacity.",
    "image": "/images/blog/day4-restaurant-covers.webp",
